      "claimId": "C10920-2",
      "statement": "Islington will continue to handle minor repairs such as potholes using internal teams.",
      "sourceQuote": "While the contract has not yet been awarded, the council will retain some minor highway maintenance works to be delivered by its in-house team. This includes minor reactive highway maintenance such as carriageway and footway repairs, pothole repairs, small patching, and replacing broken gully grates.",
